{
  "about": "Labelled duplicate pairs for DuplicateFinder. Corpus: the 10 issue titles from scripts/db/seed.ts verbatim (s01-s10, no descriptions, as seeded) plus 30 written issues (w01-w30). Queries are bare titles, as typed into the composer. Categories: paraphrase (same intent, shares some content words), lexical_gap (same intent, shares almost no content words), hard_negative (shares vocabulary, different intent), unrelated. Every label and every dev/test split was fixed when the query was written, before any score was computed. Written by the project author, so it is not an independent benchmark.",
